WEBVTT

00:09:58.676 --> 00:10:02.876
which is totally routine
and compulsory for lawyers

00:10:02.916 --> 00:10:04.716
and other modern professionals.

00:10:05.276 --> 00:10:09.596
But because no one is supposed
to tell a judge what to do

00:10:09.636 --> 00:10:11.076
or how to think,

00:10:11.116 --> 00:10:14.676
in case that undermines
their independence,

00:10:14.716 --> 00:10:16.516
it's all voluntary.

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:21.156
In principle, a judge like me
could just say no.

00:10:22.036 --> 00:10:28.116
And that CPD label neatly avoids
the elephant in the room,

00:10:28.156 --> 00:10:32.916
the fact that every modern lawyer
needs at least some help